  "answer": "No, the kitchen doesn't come with a stove. Most customers prefer to choose their own cooking setup, so we leave that part to you. What you do get is a complete standalone unit with two removable water tanks (one for fresh water, one for grey water), a battery-powered tap, a sink and a table. You won't need an external battery or water supply, because the tap runs off its own battery and the tanks are built into the unit.",
